# stretis-transpiler

CLI + library for turning a public OpenAPI/Discovery/GraphQL spec into the stretis schema DSL, on demand, locally.

## Install

```bash
pip install stretis-transpiler
```

## Usage

```bash
stretis transpile                    # every app in the manifest
stretis transpile stripe asana       # just these apps
stretis transpile --check-drift      # refuse to apply breaking changes
stretis transpile --check-drift --smoke_test     # cross-check every generated  api schema for authenticity
without review
stretis manifest show                # see which manifest is active
stretis manifest update              # explicit refresh — never automatic
stretis manifest reset               # back to the bundled default
```

